        The view this names is declared by the keyboard fork's input_view.xml,
        not here. Declaring the id in this module as well keeps the adapter
        that mounts into it compiling and unit-testable without the submodule
        pointer bump landing first; resource merging folds the two
        declarations into a single entry, so both R classes name one view.
